    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You gain a single Follower. Choose either the Aggressive, Defensive, or Utility <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Follower_Templates\" title=\"Follower Templates\">Follower Template</a> for your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Follower\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Follower\">Follower</a>, generating the follower's statistics using the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Followers\" title=\"Followers\">Followers</a> rules. This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Follower\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Follower\">Follower</a> gains the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Training_(Perception)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Training (Perception)\">Skill Training (Perception)</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Training_(Stealth)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Training (Stealth)\">Skill Training (Stealth)</a> Feats. Additionally, whenever you use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> skill, all your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Followers\" title=\"Followers\">Followers</a> can also make <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> checks as a part of the same Action if they are able to.<br><br>You can select this Talent up to three times. Each time you do, you gain one additional <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Follower\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Follower\">Follower</a>.",
